  m_text: 'Welcome to the Aorta Terminology room!


    This interactive experience
    enables you to learn more about the different parts of the Aorta.


    Button
    Instructions:


    - Inspect: click on this button to pan around and zoom in
    on the Heart and Aorta model


    -Terminology: click on this button to show
    the different names of the sections of the Aorta


    - Minigame: click on this
    button to load a drag and drop terminology minigame


    -Back To Corridor:
    click this button to go back to the hospital corridor and continue your educational
    experience once you finish exploring this room.


'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
